      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now let me check the working directory and look for `AbstractInputStreamTest` for the parameterized test source.I have all the context I need. The improvements I'll make:\n1. Remove unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertNotNull`, `assertTrue`, `EOFException`, `StringUtils`)\n2. Remove unused constant `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED`\n3. Rename `shadow` to `closedStream` — the current name is cryptic and obscures intentThe improved test compiles successfully. The changes made were: removed five unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertNotNull`, `assertTrue`, `EOFException`, `StringUtils`), removed the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, and renamed the opaque `shadow` variable to `closedStream` to clearly communicate that the variable holds a reference to the stream after it has been closed."
